<h1>不安の記録</h1>
<p class="hint-text">
心を落ち着ける呼吸法が始まります。
</p>
<h3>今の不安はどれくらい？</h3>



<div class="anxiety-buttons">
    <%= button_to "1", anxiety_logs_path, params: { anxiety_level: 1, next: params[:next] }, class: "anxiety-level-1" %>
    <%= button_to "2", anxiety_logs_path, params: { anxiety_level: 2, next: params[:next] }, class: "anxiety-level-2" %>
    <%= button_to "3", anxiety_logs_path, params: { anxiety_level: 3, next: params[:next] }, class: "anxiety-level-3" %>
    <%= button_to "4", anxiety_logs_path, params: { anxiety_level: 4, next: params[:next] }, class: "anxiety-level-4" %>
    <%= button_to "5", anxiety_logs_path, params: { anxiety_level: 5, next: params[:next] }, class: "anxiety-level-5" %>
</div>


